  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Mai Tide is a newly available vacation rental that offers an extraordinary experience in a 4-bedroom, 3.5-bath house, designed to comfortably accommodate up to 10 guests. The sleeping arrangements include a Queen master bedroom on the first floor and a King master bedroom on the second floor, alongside another room with a Queen bed and a fourth bedroom featuring four Twin bunk beds. <br><br>This splendid property is located in the serene Rosemary/Inlet beach area, known for its beautiful resort-style community pool which is just a short 2-3 minute walk away. The beach, an enchanting destination, is conveniently accessible within a 4-minute ride by the provided 6-seater golf cart or bikes.<br><br>Mai Tide boasts an array of amenities to enhance your vacationing experience. It comes equipped with two bicycles, beach chairs, umbrellas, and toys for endless fun under the sun. The community pool is a refreshing retreat for guests. The house features a breathtaking outdoor space that includes a gas grill and fire pit, perfect for evening gatherings and barbecues. For sports enthusiasts, there's a basketball hoop to enjoy some active leisure time.<br><br>As you step inside Mai Tide, you're welcomed by a charming nautical theme with shiplap walls and navy décor, creating a cozy beachside ambiance. The living room offers ample seating for all guests and includes a working fireplace, adding warmth and comfort to your stay. The kitchen is a chef's delight, well-equipped for preparing delectable meals, complemented by a charming dining area.<br><br>The outdoor area is not just about grilling; it's a space where you can gather around the fire pit for some marshmallow roasting. The convenience of a full-size washer and dryer in the laundry room means you don't have to worry about running out of fresh outfits. Additional perks include a delightful kids' nook off the living room, a spacious outdoor patio furnished for relaxation, and plenty of storage space for all your beach gear.<br><br>With its combination of comfort, luxury, and a wide array of amenities, Mai Tide is an ideal choice for those seeking a memorable beach vacation. Happy vacationing at Mai Tide, where every detail is catered to ensure a delightful stay!<br><br>HELPFUL NEIGHBORHOOD INFORMATION:<br>- This home is located just 1 block from the Grande Pointe Community Pool.<br><br>TRANSPORTATION:<br>- A 6 seater golf cart is provided with this rental.<br>- 2 Bikes are provided with this rental<br><br>\"MAI TIDE\" BED CONFIGURATIONS: (Sleeps 10)<br>- Master Suite, First Floor: Queen Bed, Private Bathroom with Tub/Shower Combo<br>- Master Suite, Second Floor: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Separate Tub and Shower<br>- Bedroom 3, Second Floor: Queen Bed, Shared Bathroom with Tub/Shower Combo<br>- Bedroom 4, Second Floor: 2 Set of Twin Bunks<br><br>FEATURES:<br>- 4 Bedrooms / 3.5 Bathrooms, Sleeps 10<br>- Located in the Grande Pointe Neighborhood in Inlet Beach<br>- Community Pool<br>- Community Grilling Area<br>- Fully Appointed Kitchen<br>- Full-Size Refrigerator with Ice Maker<br>- Granite Countertops<br>- Complimentary Wireless Internet<br>- Full-Size Washer & Dryer<br>- Off-Street Parking",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Experience the Charm of Mai Tide: A Luxurious 4-Bedroom Retreat Near the Beach!"
        }
      ],
