            "response": "Thank you so much for the wonderful 10/10 review! 🌟🏡 We’re so happy to hear everything was perfect and that you loved the home, location, and cleanliness.\n\nIt was a pleasure hosting you, and we’d love to welcome you back for another stay anytime! 😊🏖️",
