      {
        "author": "Hailie K.",
        "date": "2025-06-13T03:48:09Z",
        "id": "684ba2de7eb47b52fdfc004f",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Mai Tide was the perfect spot for my family. Located right by our favorite restaurants and walking distance to Rosemary Beach town square! The neighborhood is quaint and has the perfect pool for laying and swimming! We will definitely be back :) thanks Mai Tide!",
        "title": "Perfect Getaway Spot"
      },
      {
        "author": "taisiya t.",
        "date": "2025-07-08T13:23:15Z",
        "id": "686dea0385df26099daea8e5",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "We loved staying at the Mai Tide house. The house was beautiful, clean, and stocked with all the needed essentials for a weekend trip. We loved having the golf cart for short rides to the beach that was directly across the street. Thank you so much for hosting us. I would definitely recommend and would stay again!! Additionally, customer service is amazing!! I love how quick they were to respond to my one questions.",
        "title": "Wonderful Stay"
      },
      {
        "author": "Kevin B.",
        "date": "2025-06-13T16:21:00Z",
        "id": "684cf45267085001fe12ddfb",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Took a recent girls trip to 30A and stayed at Mai Tide. We loved the location as it is not congested like some areas but very convenient to get to great beach, shopping and restaurants. Can easily walk ot take golf cart to beach and restaurants. The house was great. It was very roomy and light and we all had our own bedrooms! Would definitely return to this area and home!! Also has a great pool in the neighborhood and never had to wait for chairs!",
        "title": "Great trip"
      },
      {
        "author": "Kevin B.",
        "date": "2024-01-06T05:05:39Z",
        "id": "6598dfa474e6f8786bdf946f",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "The Perfect Get-a-way for fun, sun, and relaxation! Mai Tide was amazing!-exceeded our expectations and felt just like home. Easy access to beach and lots of restaurants. Looking forward to planning our next trip there!",
        "title": "AMAZING Stay"
      }
